OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny coastal  
OL,6,Fshowers will soon clear, followed by a 
OL,7,Fdry and cold night with light winds.   
OL,8,FThis will allow a widespread frost to  
OL,9,Fdevelop, with the odd patch of         
OL,10,Ffreezing mist and fog forming.         
OL,12,CSaturday:FA cold and clear morning,    
OL,13,Fany freezing fog patches slowly        
OL,14,Fclearing. A bright and sunny           
OL,15,Fafternoon, with light winds, but still 
OL,16,Ffeeling cool, with temperatures        
OL,17,Fremaining in the single digits.        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
